{"@context":["https://schema.org",{"emsenn":"https://emsenn.net/vocab#","skos":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"}],"@id":"https://emsenn.net/letters/2020-10-20-talkative-tuesdays/","@type":"Article","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"emsenn"},"dateModified":"2020-10-20","datePublished":"2020-10-20","description":"Howdy folks! I hope everyone’s been having a decent week so far. I’ve been getting really anxious after the sun goes down myself: where I live gets targeted by fascists because of the free market, and the election is getting closer. …","name":"2020-10-20, Talkative Tuesdays","publisher":{"@type":"Person","name":"emsenn","url":"https://emsenn.net"},"url":"https://emsenn.net/letters/2020-10-20-talkative-tuesdays/"}